{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1409840/extras/b45723ea6ad52f37d83f602ae6cc69d8.webp?t=1768551804\" width=318 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the role of the <i>Tlatoani</i>, the divine ruler of Tenochtitl\u00e1n. Build your city upon the waters of Lake Texcoco, lead your people to glory \u2013 and defy the darkness that threatens to devour the sun forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1409840/extras/7c642e191673b612e963bee391b5c6a5.webp?t=1768551804\" width=273 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1409840/extras/7e3f4989af2cc41f998f10aa18f36ed8.poster.avif?t=1768551804\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1409840/extras/7e3f4989af2cc41f998f10aa18f36ed8.webm?t=1768551804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct over <strong>25 unique building types</strong> with individual <strong>upgrades</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Terraform</strong> the lake Texcoco, <strong>build canals, and reclaim precious land</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raise monumental <strong>temples</strong>, <strong>academies</strong>, and <strong>gardens</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1409840/extras/ee2b2ad00507758915f206a2cb0b820a.webp?t=1768551804\" width=315 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1409840/extras/b783bfb10b5fd4730907c1f98501c4a2.poster.avif?t=1768551804\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1409840/extras/b783bfb10b5fd4730907c1f98501c4a2.webm?t=1768551804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perform <strong>rituals</strong> and <strong>human sacrifices</strong> to gain <strong>divine protection</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decide the fate of captives and people</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balance the favor of the <strong>gods</strong>, your <strong>economy</strong>, and <strong>survival</strong> itself</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1409840/extras/79bd9aa6a40c6f2f9427a8ff9f5256f9.webp?t=1768551804\" width=308 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1409840/extras/65e7c54515fad0f7ed8509c124f859e5.poster.avif?t=1768551804\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1409840/extras/65e7c54515fad0f7ed8509c124f859e5.webm?t=1768551804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span